          "skill": "inferences",
          "passage": "In her ethnographic work on urban Native communities in the San Francisco Bay Area, anthropologist Renya Ramirez of the University of California, Santa Cruz reports two recurring patterns. First, the Native people she works with sustain their tribal identities through a mobile network of gatherings, ceremonies, family visits, and inter-city travel that extends across reservations, cities, and tribal homelands. Second, those same individuals describe their identities as fully Native and fully tied to a home community, even when they have lived away from the reservation for most or all of their lives. Ramirez's observations therefore imply that an account of Native identity that defines authenticity by continued residence on a reservation ______",
